It shall be unlawful for any person to establish, operate, or maintain any junkyard, any portion of which is within 1,000 feet of the nearest edge of the right-of-way of any highway, street, avenue, or alley, located in the city, except the following:
A. Those which are screened by natural objects, plantings, fences, or other appropriate means so as not to be visible from the main traveled way of such highway systems, or otherwise removed from sight;
B. Those located within areas which are zoned light industry (LI) and heavy industry (HI).

